From 5940f78f39598067b6e3e00d8aa54de491c069d7 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Charles Hu <charles@hu.codes>
Date: Thu, 23 Apr 2026 19:52:44 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] Revert upstream ICU PR #2579

ICU introduced MessageFormat 2.0 in PR #2579. This change added more
entries to `enum UErrorCode`, making it incompatible with `UErrorCode`
in older versions of ICU, such as the system ICU on Debian 12. As a
result, projects that use both SwiftFoundation and system ICU fail to
build due to this mismatch.

Since SwiftFoundation does not use MessageFormat, revert PR #2579 in
swift-foundation-icu until we can find a more permanent solution.
